LangString INSTALLER_LAUNCH_FAILED ${LANG_ENGLISH} "EQIDIS AI could not be launched. Retry, or clear Launch now and close the installer."
LangString INSTALLER_LAUNCH_FAILED ${LANG_SIMPCHINESE} "无法启动 EQIDIS AI。请重试，或取消勾选立即启动后关闭安装程序。"
