LangString INSTALLER_UI_ERROR ${LANG_ENGLISH} "The installer could not initialize its window. Close it and try again."
LangString INSTALLER_UI_ERROR ${LANG_SIMPCHINESE} "无法初始化安装窗口，请关闭后重试。"
LangString INSTALLER_UI_ERROR ${LANG_SPANISHINTERNATIONAL} "No se pudo abrir la ventana de instalación. Cierra el instalador e inténtalo de nuevo."
LangString INSTALLER_THEME_ERROR ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Use /THEME=auto, /THEME=light or /THEME=dark."
LangString INSTALLER_THEME_ERROR ${LANG_SIMPCHINESE} "主题参数须为 /THEME=auto、/THEME=light 或 /THEME=dark。"
LangString INSTALLER_THEME_ERROR ${LANG_SPANISHINTERNATIONAL} "Usa /THEME=auto, /THEME=light o /THEME=dark."
LangString INSTALLER_FAILED ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Installation did not finish. Close this installer and retry. If the problem persists, download the installer again."
LangString INSTALLER_FAILED ${LANG_SIMPCHINESE} "安装未完成，请关闭安装程序后重试。如仍然失败，请重新下载安装包。"
LangString INSTALLER_FAILED ${LANG_SPANISHINTERNATIONAL} "La instalación no terminó. Cierra el instalador y reintenta. Si el problema continúa, descarga el instalador de nuevo."
LangString INSTALLER_RUNNING ${LANG_ENGLISH} "EQIDIS AI is running. Quit it from the system tray and try again."
LangString INSTALLER_RUNNING ${LANG_SIMPCHINESE} "EQIDIS AI 正在运行，请先在系统托盘中退出应用后重试。"
LangString INSTALLER_RUNNING ${LANG_SPANISHINTERNATIONAL} "EQIDIS AI está en ejecución. Ciérrala desde la bandeja del sistema e inténtalo de nuevo."
LangString INSTALLER_PATH_INVALID ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Choose a full local folder path. Drive roots, system folders, links and special characters are not supported."
LangString INSTALLER_PATH_INVALID ${LANG_SIMPCHINESE} "请选择本地磁盘上的完整文件夹路径，不能使用磁盘根目录、系统目录、链接目录或包含特殊字符的路径。"
LangString INSTALLER_PATH_INVALID ${LANG_SPANISHINTERNATIONAL} "Elige una ruta local completa. No se admiten raíces de unidad, carpetas del sistema, enlaces ni caracteres especiales."
LangString INSTALLER_PATH_OWNERSHIP ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Choose an empty folder or the registered EQIDIS AI installation folder."
LangString INSTALLER_PATH_OWNERSHIP ${LANG_SIMPCHINESE} "请选择空文件夹，或 EQIDIS AI 原来的安装目录。"
LangString INSTALLER_PATH_OWNERSHIP ${LANG_SPANISHINTERNATIONAL} "Elige una carpeta vacía o la carpeta donde está instalada EQIDIS AI."
LangString INSTALLER_PATH_WRITABLE ${LANG_ENGLISH} "This location is not writable. Choose a folder available to the current user."
LangString INSTALLER_PATH_WRITABLE ${LANG_SIMPCHINESE} "无法写入此位置。请选择当前用户可写入的文件夹；安装程序不会申请管理员权限。"
LangString INSTALLER_PATH_WRITABLE ${LANG_SPANISHINTERNATIONAL} "No se puede escribir en esta ubicación. Elige una carpeta disponible para tu usuario."
LangString INSTALLER_DISK_SPACE ${LANG_ENGLISH} "There is not enough free disk space. Choose another location."
LangString INSTALLER_DISK_SPACE ${LANG_SIMPCHINESE} "此磁盘的可用空间不足，请选择其他位置。"
LangString INSTALLER_DISK_SPACE ${LANG_SPANISHINTERNATIONAL} "No hay suficiente espacio libre. Elige otra ubicación."
LangString INSTALLER_PER_USER ${LANG_ENGLISH} "This installer supports the current user only. Uninstall the existing all-users installation first."
LangString INSTALLER_PER_USER ${LANG_SIMPCHINESE} "此安装程序仅支持当前用户。请先卸载已有的所有用户安装版本。"
LangString INSTALLER_PER_USER ${LANG_SPANISHINTERNATIONAL} "Este instalador solo admite tu usuario. Primero desinstala la versión existente para todos los usuarios."
LangString INSTALLER_EXTRACT_FAILED ${LANG_ENGLISH} "The application files could not be extracted."
LangString INSTALLER_EXTRACT_FAILED ${LANG_SIMPCHINESE} "无法解压应用程序文件。"
LangString INSTALLER_EXTRACT_FAILED ${LANG_SPANISHINTERNATIONAL} "No se pudieron extraer los archivos de la aplicación."
LangString INSTALLER_EXTRACT_HINT ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Security software may have blocked a file, or the disk may be full. Close this installer and try again. If it keeps failing, send us the error details below."
LangString INSTALLER_EXTRACT_HINT ${LANG_SIMPCHINESE} "可能是安全软件拦截了文件，或磁盘空间不足。请关闭安装程序后重试；如仍然失败，请将下方错误信息发送给我们。"
LangString INSTALLER_EXTRACT_HINT ${LANG_SPANISHINTERNATIONAL} "El software de seguridad pudo bloquear un archivo o el disco está lleno. Cierra el instalador y reintenta. Si el problema continúa, comparte los detalles del error que aparecen abajo."
